{
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "title": "Christ Formed Among Us",
  "tagline": "Christ is forming you personally, but He never intended to form you privately.",
  "series": "The Battle Before the Battle",
  "seo_title": "Christian Brotherhood: Christ Formed Among Us | TheWrkShop",
  "seo_description": "Christ is forming you personally, but He never intended to form you privately. What it means to help one another become like Jesus.",
  "og_image": "/assets/og/christ-formed-among-us.png",
  "scriptures": [
    {
      "ref": "Ephesians 4:15-16",
      "text": "“Speaking the truth in love, we will grow to become in every respect the mature body of him who is the head, that is, Christ. From him the whole body…. grows and builds itself up in love, as each part does its work.”"
    },
    {
      "ref": "Hebrews 10:24",
      "text": "“And let us consider how we may spur one another on toward love and good deeds….”"
    },
    {
      "ref": "Galatians 6:2",
      "text": "“Carry each other’s burdens, and in this way you will fulfill the law of Christ.”"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "the_revelation",
      "label": "The Revelation",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "We started with Peter.",
            "Certain men walked into the room.",
            "Peter became afraid.",
            "His behavior changed.",
            "Other Jews followed.",
            "Even Barnabas was swept into it.",
            "One man’s fear began forming the room."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "That showed us something:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "PEOPLE FORM PEOPLE."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But now we need to turn that truth around."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Because if people can help form one another toward:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "fear,",
            "hypocrisy,",
            "comparison,",
            "hiding,",
            "compromise,",
            "pride,",
            "and conformity,",
            "then redeemed community can help form people toward:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "truth,",
            "courage,",
            "repentance,",
            "faithfulness,",
            "humility,",
            "love,",
            "and Christlikeness."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "That’s the other side of communal formation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_lie",
      "label": "The Lie",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“MY SPIRITUAL GROWTH IS BETWEEN ME AND GOD.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "There is truth inside that statement.",
            "Nobody can repent for you.",
            "Nobody can believe for you.",
            "Nobody can obey for you.",
            "Nobody can remain in Christ for you.",
            "Your relationship with God cannot be outsourced."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But biblical Christianity never turns that personal responsibility into spiritual isolation."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The New Testament repeatedly says:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "one another.",
            "Love one another.",
            "Serve one another.",
            "Forgive one another.",
            "Confess to one another.",
            "Encourage one another.",
            "Carry one another’s burdens.",
            "Teach one another.",
            "Admonish one another.",
            "Pray for one another.",
            "Build one another up."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "GOD DID NOT DESIGN DISCIPLESHIP AS A SOLO PROJECT."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_truth",
      "label": "The Truth",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "CHRIST IS FORMING A PEOPLE."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Ephesians 4 doesn’t merely describe mature individuals."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Paul says:"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“the whole body….”"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Growing.",
            "Building.",
            "Working.",
            "Together."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "That means maturity is not merely:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“AM I BECOMING LIKE JESUS?”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "There is another question:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“ARE WE HELPING ONE ANOTHER BECOME LIKE JESUS?”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Now brotherhood becomes something much deeper than friendship."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Friendship may say:"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“I enjoy being around you.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Brotherhood says:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“I CARE ABOUT WHO YOU ARE BECOMING.”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "brotherhood_is_formational",
      "label": "Brotherhood Is Formational",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "A brother notices when you’re drifting.",
            "A brother celebrates when you’re growing."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A brother asks the question everybody else avoids."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A brother reminds you what is true when fear gets loud."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A brother refuses to participate in your self-deception."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A brother doesn’t abandon you when you confess."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A brother doesn’t flatter you when correction is needed."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A brother doesn’t compete with your success."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A brother doesn’t turn your failure into entertainment."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "A brother prays.",
            "Calls.",
            "Checks.",
            "Challenges.",
            "Listens.",
            "Stays.",
            "Why?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Because:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "YOUR FORMATION MATTERS TO HIM."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“AS EACH PART DOES ITS WORK”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Don’t miss those words in Ephesians 4."
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“.…as each part does its work.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "That means communal formation isn’t only the pastor’s assignment."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Or leader’s.",
            "Or teacher’s.",
            "Or facilitator’s."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "EACH PART."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The man who barely speaks still affects the room."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "The man who encourages affects the room.",
            "The man who mocks affects the room.",
            "The man who confesses affects the room.",
            "The man who celebrates affects the room.",
            "The man who gossips affects the room."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The man who tells the truth affects the room."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The man who refuses compromise affects the room."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "THERE ARE NO FORMATIONALLY NEUTRAL MEMBERS OF A COMMUNITY."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "We are always contributing something."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_room_can_remember_for_you",
      "label": "The Room Can Remember for You",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "This is one of the gifts of brotherhood."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Sometimes you forget.",
            "You forget who God is.",
            "You forget what He has done.",
            "You forget what Scripture says.",
            "You forget who you are in Christ.",
            "Fear gets loud.",
            "Pain narrows vision.",
            "Shame rewrites the story."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And a brother says:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“BROTHER, THAT’S NOT THE WHOLE STORY.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "He brings truth back into the room.",
            "Not because he becomes your Holy Spirit."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Not because you become dependent upon him instead of Christ."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But because God often uses His people to remind His people of His truth."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Sometimes:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "YOUR BROTHER REMEMBERS UNTIL YOU CAN SEE CLEARLY AGAIN."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_room_can_lend_courage",
      "label": "The Room Can Lend Courage",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Courage can also become contagious.",
            "One man tells the truth."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Another realizes:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Maybe I can too.",
            "One man confesses."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Another thinks:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Maybe I don’t have to hide.",
            "One man refuses the joke."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Another realizes:",
            "I wasn’t comfortable with it either."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "One man says:"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“I was wrong.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Another discovers apology doesn’t destroy masculinity.",
            "One man celebrates another man’s success.",
            "Competition loses oxygen.",
            "One man asks for help."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Another realizes:",
            "Maybe strength doesn’t require pretending."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "COURAGE CAN CHANGE WHAT BECOMES POSSIBLE IN THE ROOM."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Just like fear did in Galatians 2."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "but_the_room_cannot_become_your_god",
      "label": "But the Room Cannot Become Your God",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Important guardrail.",
            "Community is powerful.",
            "But community is not Christ."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Brotherhood cannot carry the weight of ultimate identity."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The group cannot become the final interpreter of your life."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Because even Christian communities can drift.",
            "Peter drifted.",
            "Barnabas followed.",
            "Churches can become unhealthy.",
            "Leaders can become wrong.",
            "Groups can normalize what Scripture condemns."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "So:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "COMMUNITY HELPS FORM US."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "SCRIPTURE GOVERNS US."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "THE SPIRIT TRANSFORMS US."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "CHRIST REMAINS LORD."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The room never gets the throne."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "this_changes_the_workshop",
      "label": "This Changes the Workshop",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "TheWrkShop cannot merely be:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "men attending Bible study.",
            "Men consuming content.",
            "Men hearing teaching.",
            "Men answering breakout questions.",
            "Men showing up Wednesday.",
            "Those things can be valuable."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But the deeper vision is:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "MEN PARTICIPATING IN ONE ANOTHER’S FORMATION."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Now attendance isn’t the destination.",
            "Information isn’t the destination.",
            "Even vulnerability isn’t the destination."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The destination remains:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "CHRIST FORMED IN US."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And increasingly:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "CHRIST RECOGNIZABLE AMONG US."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "what_would_that_room_look_like",
      "label": "What Would That Room Look Like?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A room where:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Truth is spoken in love.",
            "Confession doesn’t become gossip.",
            "Success doesn’t create competition.",
            "Failure doesn’t create entertainment.",
            "Correction doesn’t mean rejection.",
            "Weakness doesn’t mean worthlessness.",
            "Strength doesn’t require pretending.",
            "Disagreement doesn’t destroy brotherhood.",
            "Leadership doesn’t eliminate accountability.",
            "Money doesn’t determine significance.",
            "Influence doesn’t determine worth.",
            "Marriage is honored.",
            "Women are spoken about with dignity.",
            "Fathers take responsibility.",
            "Men ask for help.",
            "Men keep their word.",
            "Men pray for one another.",
            "Men follow up.",
            "Men repent.",
            "Men forgive.",
            "Men return."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And above everything:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "JESUS REMAINS LORD OF THE ROOM."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_deeper_battle",
      "label": "The Deeper Battle",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Now we can see something bigger."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "The Battle Before the Battle isn’t only:",
            "What happens inside me before behavior?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "It can also be:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENS BETWEEN US BEFORE CULTURE FORMS?"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "A joke.",
            "A silence.",
            "A celebration.",
            "A reaction.",
            "A correction.",
            "A confession.",
            "A compromise.",
            "A courageous sentence.",
            "Repeated long enough,",
            "these become culture."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And culture eventually begins shaping the next person who enters."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "So:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "TODAY’S REACTIONS CAN BECOME TOMORROW’S ROOM."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "That means culture formation is upstream formation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_audit",
      "label": "The Audit",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Don’t only ask:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "WHO IS FORMING ME?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Ask:"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet_list",
          "items": [
            "WHO AM I HELPING FORM?",
            "WHAT DOES MY PRESENCE REINFORCE?",
            "WHO CAN TELL ME THE TRUTH?",
            "WHOSE BURDEN AM I HELPING CARRY?",
            "WHO AM I ENCOURAGING?",
            "WHO AM I CHALLENGING?",
            "WHO AM I PRAYING FOR?",
            "WHO WOULD CALL ME BEFORE MAKING A TERRIBLE DECISION?",
            "WHO KNOWS WHERE MY OWN BATTLE IS?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And finally:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "IF EVERY MAN CONTRIBUTED WHAT I CONTRIBUTE, WHAT KIND OF BROTHERHOOD WOULD WE HAVE?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Sit with that one."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_surrender",
      "label": "The Surrender",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Stop asking only:"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“What am I getting from this room?”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Ask:"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“WHAT AM I BRINGING INTO IT?”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Bring:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "truth.",
            "humility.",
            "courage.",
            "encouragement.",
            "repentance.",
            "prayer.",
            "faithfulness.",
            "wisdom.",
            "joy.",
            "presence.",
            "love."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And when you fail to bring those things:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "bring repentance.",
            "Because even repentance helps form the room."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_10_5_moment",
      "label": "The 10:5 Moment",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Before entering your next room, ask:"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet_list",
          "items": [
            "WHAT AM I BRINGING WITH ME?",
            "WHAT WILL MY REACTIONS REWARD?",
            "WHAT WILL MY SILENCE PERMIT?",
            "WHAT WILL MY WORDS STRENGTHEN?",
            "WILL PEOPLE FEEL PRESSURE TO PERFORM AROUND ME?",
            "CAN TRUTH SURVIVE IN MY PRESENCE?",
            "AM I HELPING PEOPLE MOVE TOWARD CHRIST?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And ultimately:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "IS CHRIST BECOMING RECOGNIZABLE AMONG US?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "take_it_with_you",
      "label": "Take It With You",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "Christ is forming you personally, but He never intended to form you privately."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_prayer",
      "label": "The Prayer",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Father,",
            "Thank You that You did not call me to walk alone."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Thank You for brothers who encourage, confront, pray, listen, correct, celebrate, carry, and stay."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Forgive me where I have treated community as something merely to consume."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Show me what I contribute."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Teach me to become the kind of brother I keep hoping to find."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "When another man forgets, help me remind him."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "When he grows weary, help me strengthen him."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "When he succeeds, help me celebrate.",
            "When he sins, help me restore gently."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "When he wanders, give me courage to speak."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "When he tells the truth, make me trustworthy."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And give me brothers who will do the same for me."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Holy Spirit,",
            "form Christ in us."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Not merely individually.",
            "Among us.",
            "In our conversations.",
            "In our reactions.",
            "In our disagreements.",
            "In our celebrations.",
            "In our corrections.",
            "In our confessions.",
            "In our failures.",
            "In our victories."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Build a brotherhood where Jesus is not merely discussed,",
            "but increasingly recognizable."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Jesus is Lord of this room.",
            "Let our lives increasingly agree."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "In Jesus name,",
            "Amen."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "hidden_gems",
      "label": "Hidden Gems 💎",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "Christ is forming you personally, but He never intended to form you privately."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Friendship says, “I enjoy being around you.” Brotherhood says, “I care about who you are becoming.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "There are no formationally neutral members of a community."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Sometimes your brother remembers until you can see clearly again."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Courage can change what becomes possible in the room."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Community helps form us. Scripture governs us. The Spirit transforms us. Christ remains Lord."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Today’s reactions can become tomorrow’s room."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Culture formation is upstream formation."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Teach me to become the kind of brother I keep hoping to find."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Jesus is Lord of this room. Let our lives increasingly agree."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "-TheWrkShop"
